<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>JavaScript String Operations</title>

<style>
* {
box-sizing: border-box;
margin: 0;
